   "h": "Urinary tract obstruction — algorithm (เล่มเหลือง)",
   "html": "<div class=\"flow\" data-flow=\"y42a\"></div><h5>Lower urinary tract obstruction (ต่ำกว่า vesicoureteral junction) → Acute urinary retention</h5><ul><li><b>Anatomical obstruction</b><ul><li>Bladder: CA bladder, Stone · DM, MS, Parkinson</li><li>Prostate: BPH, CA prostate · Prostatitis</li><li>Urethral stricture: Trauma, instrument · GC urethritis</li></ul></li><li><b>Functional obstruction</b><ul><li>Neurogenic bladder: Spinal cord injury · DM, MS, Parkinson</li><li>Urethral valve: Anticholinergic · Antidepressant · Levodopa</li></ul></li></ul><h5>Upper urinary tract obstruction (เหนือต่อ vesicoureteral junction) → Oliguria/Anuria from upper tract obstruction</h5><ul><li><b>Intrinsic obstruction</b><ul><li>Intraluminal: Stone · Blood clot · Papillary tissue</li><li>Extraluminal: Functional (Ureteral Vesicle Junction dysfunction) · Anatomical (tumor, infection)</li></ul></li><li><b>Extrinsic obstruction</b><ul><li>GU: Preg, CA cervix</li><li>Vascular: Aneurysm</li><li>GI: Tumor</li><li>Retroperitoneum: LN, Fibrosis · Tumor</li></ul></li></ul>"
  }
 ],
